WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.762
Now we reverse the direction The monthly sales table
stores January

00:00:05.933 --> 00:00:11.605
February and March as separate columns That is
convenient for a fixed

00:00:11.632 --> 00:00:17.487
report but less flexible for many analytical tasks
Unpivoting

00:00:17.514 --> 00:00:20.224
turns those month columns back into row values
